<title>USA: Jos. A Bank Q3 same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Jos. A Bank Q3 same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPSTEAD, Md. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	    $36.8	$30.8  +   19.5  +    19.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $107.9	$98.8  +    9.2  +    11.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Quarter is  four weeks ended  November 2.</p>
<p>Full company name is Jos. A Bank Clothiers</p>
